{
  "about": "Lapok (WP-46): ready-made sheets for the + menu. A window is { open, state, c, r, w, h } on the 4 x 4 grid (c, r from 0; w, h in cells; tiles must not overlap). open = 'pane:<kind>' (home files term web mail stack chat note git feed) or 'cat:<catalog id>' (an item of launcher/vrg-catalog.json that opens as a window: an in-shell app, a server page, a pane). level = the lowest Szint the preset shows at. focus (optional) = the index in wins of the window that gets the keyboard when the sheet opens (a browser: its address / search box).",
